flowchart TD
    START([Receive email]) --> INPUT[Check input format and restore conversation context]
    INPUT --> AI1
    subgraph PHASE1[Stage 1: Understand and triage]
        AI1[One LLM call: human request, multiple intents, risk, missing information, search direction]
        AI1 --> CHECK1[Program validates analysis and enforces routing constraints]
    end
    style PHASE1 stroke-dasharray: 6 4
    CHECK1 --> ROUTE{Next step}
    ROUTE -->|Human requested, risk or analysis failure| HUMAN[Human handling]
    ROUTE -->|Missing required customer information| ASK[AI prepares a specific clarification question]
    ROUTE -->|Can proceed| SEARCH[Retrieve relevant knowledge passages]
    SEARCH --> EMPTY{Retrieval empty?}
    EMPTY -->|Yes| GAP[Seek additional approved sources or hand off]
    GAP --> HUMAN
    EMPTY -->|No| AI2[Stage 2: One LLM call to assess evidence applicability and draft]
    AI2 -->|Need customer information| ASK
    AI2 -->|Insufficient or conflicting evidence, or risk| HUMAN
    AI2 -->|Actionable draft produced| VALIDATE[Program checks format, citations and fixed constraints]
    VALIDATE -->|Fail| RETRY{Repairable and fewer than 3 retries?}
    RETRY -->|Yes: log error and retry count| FEEDBACK[Keep evidence and constraints; add error feedback]
    FEEDBACK --> AI2
    RETRY -->|No| HUMAN
    VALIDATE -->|Pass| REVIEW[Support reviews and edits]
    ASK --> ASKCHECK{Program checks clarification question}
    ASKCHECK -->|Fail or human judgment needed| HUMAN
    ASKCHECK -->|Pass| SEND[Automatically send clarification: target integration]
    SEND --> WAIT[Wait for customer reply]
    WAIT --> MERGE[Merge original email, question and new reply]
    MERGE --> INPUT
    HUMAN --> REVIEW
    REVIEW --> APPROVE{Support approves sending?}
    APPROVE -->|No| HOLD[Save edits or rejection record; do not send]
    APPROVE -->|Yes| SAVE[Save approved final text and review record]
    SAVE --> SENDANSWER[Send the approved email to the customer: target integration]
    SENDANSWER --> SENT{Delivery service result}
    SENT -->|Success| DONE([Save sent status and delivery receipt])
    SENT -->|Failed or unknown| SENDFAIL[Record failed or uncertain delivery; support checks]
